1
00:00:00,134 --> 00:00:03,804
(Sheldon:)Sometimes your lack of social skills
astonishes me.

2
00:00:04,555 --> 00:00:08,055
(Leonard:)What do you want?

3
00:00:08,768 --> 00:00:11,018
You may wanna sit down.

4
00:00:11,437 --> 00:00:13,067
(Leonard:)I'm in bed.

5
00:00:13,981 --> 00:00:16,521
Point taken. You may wanna sit up.

6
00:00:16,692 --> 00:00:18,232
(Leonard:)Sheldon!

7
00:00:20,446 --> 00:00:22,736
(Sheldon:)I've been seeing Penny
behind your back.

8
00:00:30,456 --> 00:00:31,996
(Penny:)Okay.

9
00:00:33,626 --> 00:00:38,256
When you say "seeing Penny,"
what exactly does that mean?

10
00:00:38,798 --> 00:00:40,468
(Sheldon:)We had dinner last night.

11
00:00:40,633 --> 00:00:43,383
(Sheldon:)She made me spaghetti
with little hot dogs cut up in it.

12
00:00:43,553 --> 00:00:45,183
(Sheldon:)Well, little hot dog.

13
00:00:45,346 --> 00:00:48,516
(Sheldon:)I gave up the other five hot dogs
to a real dog.

14
00:00:48,683 --> 00:00:50,603
(Sheldon:)A real big dog.

15
00:00:50,768 --> 00:00:52,188
(Sheldon:)A hell hound.

16
00:00:52,353 --> 00:00:56,483
It's tangential to the primary story.
How about I circle back to it?

17
00:00:57,608 --> 00:01:00,568
(Leonard:)Fine. Why did you
have dinner with Penny?

